Coordinate Systems
oHub Plane (Shaft Plane)
o ‘Z’ axis along rotor shaft
o Rotor is seen flapping and feathering (changes pitch) about this plane
oTip Path Plane (TPP)
o Plane in which the tips of the rotor blades move
o Rotor is seen to be only feathering. No flapping motion
oNo Feathering Plane (NFP)
o Pitch constant when seen from this plane
o Rotor is seen to be flapping only


